# Commits and safety

- Commits are authored as mstevensdesign, using that handle as both the name and the `users.noreply.github.com` address, with UTC dates. Set `GIT_AUTHOR_DATE` and `GIT_COMMITTER_DATE` in UTC, or run git with `TZ=UTC`.
- Work on `agent/<tool>/<short-task>` branches, then open a pull request.
- Normal pushes only: no force-push, no rebase, no history rewrites, and no branch deletes.
- Agents never merge PRs, never push to main and never deploy. Stop at an open PR; the owner merges after a yes.
- No personal details beyond what the owner put in the README: no home, family, town or location details.
